1
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,860
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,011 --> 00:00:12,144
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,206 --> 00:00:17,362
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:22,019
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:27,711
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,611
=Episode 14=

17
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:19,959
Shen Yanlin,

18
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:20,879
listen to me.

19
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,680
I don't care whether you used
to run with Shuangdao Hui

20
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,640
or Dongshan Tai.

21
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,599
As far as I'm concerned,
there are only two kinds of people:

22
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:29,000
those who follow the rules,

23
00:01:29,239 --> 00:01:30,599
and those who don't.

24
00:01:31,359 --> 00:01:32,319
Which one are you going to be?

25
00:01:34,599 --> 00:01:35,239
Officer Luo.

26
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,560
I don't want to be

27
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,920
either one.

28
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:41,719
I just saw you hit someone.

29
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,120
Did I hit you?

30
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,159
You're hurt.

31
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,159
Who did this to you?

32
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,400
Officer Luo asked you a question.

33
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,200
Answer him.

34
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:57,280
A pool ball bounced up

35
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,519
and hit me in the head.

36
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,079
Lin.

37
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,799
Lin?

38
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:04,799
Can I go now?

39
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:05,920
Lin.

40
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:10,039
Lin! Lin!

41
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,319
Fu!

42
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,960
He's killing someone!

43
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:14,639
Fu!

44
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:15,800
Who are you?

45
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,360
Put that down now!

46
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,159
Officer Luo.

47
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:17,719
He's my brother.

48
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:24,639
Take him away.

49
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:25,800
Officer Luo.

50
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:27,599
He has a mental disability.

51
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,039
He's killing someone!

52
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,520
Keep an eye on him.

53
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:36,960
Keep him out of trouble.

54
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:37,840
Move along.

55
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:42,639
Let's go.

56
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:44,800
I told you to stay at headquarters.

57
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,560
Why'd you come out?

58
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,199
I wanted to protect Lin.

59
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,639
What have you ever protected me from?

60
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:54,240
Lin...

61
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:57,919
I'm useless!

62
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,000
Don't cry. Don't cry.

63
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,919
Want to go get some egg tarts?

64
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,599
Take Wangcai for a walk.

65
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,479
That scared me to death.

66
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,199
You've been watching too much TV.

67
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,520
There are bad guys!

68
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,400
No. No bad guys.

69
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,280
Lin.

70
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,599
I'm heading out.

71
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:53,759
Fu.

72
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:55,960
The sun's going down.

73
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,360
How about I take you home?

74
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,159
Lin...

75
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,360
doesn't want me anymore.

76
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,840
Of course he does.

77
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:20,240
M-Maybe without me,

78
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:25,079
Lin would be better off.

79
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,519
You're the most important person to him.

80
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,040
He's under a lot of pressure.

81
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,439
That's why he snapped at you.

82
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,519
So strange.

83
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:41,040
Everyone's so strange.

84
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,399
He just wants to protect you.

85
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,199
He's worried about you, Fu.

86
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:50,439
I can protect Lin.

87
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,519
And Che too.

88
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,439
Okay. Thank you.

89
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,720
Let's go get egg tarts.

90
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:08,800
Okay?

91
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:15,040
Three.

92
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:22,639
Give me a smile.

93
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,600
Okay. Let's go.

94
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,319
Come on. Let's go.

95
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,600
Are your hands dirty?

96
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,720
You wiped them on me!

97
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,759
Fei Liu's men

98
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,040
came by a few days ago.

99
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,920
No idea what they're planning.

100
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:52,639
They wanted a stake in the complex.

101
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,120
I turned them down.

102
00:05:58,519 --> 00:05:59,240
What's wrong?

103
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:03,800
Nothing.

104
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:11,399
Actually...

105
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,800
sometimes,

106
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,000
I wish I understood you.

107
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:33,279
There are bad guys.

108
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:38,480
Bad guys.

109
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,279
Fu, sit down.

110
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,439
There are no bad guys.

111
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,561
(Dongcheng Tiger)
There are.

112
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,040
There are.

113
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:55,439
I want to help Che

114
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:59,040
and Lin.

115
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,360
Make the doggy talk.

116
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:10,920
Doggy.

117
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:12,879
Boss Lin.

118
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,360
Fei Liu's men hijacked
our jewelry shipment.

119
00:07:16,959 --> 00:07:17,839
A lot of our guys got hurt.

120
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:22,639
It's okay. It's okay.

121
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:23,720
Dazui.

122
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,680
Take my brother home.

123
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,040
Go home.

124
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,439
Get him some egg tarts.

125
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,560
Buy e-egg tarts.

126
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,040
Egg tarts.

127
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,360
Go.

128
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,240
Come on.

129
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,720
Let's go get our shipment back.

130
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,120
Lin, wait.

131
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:43,120
You guys, go outside.

132
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,120
Out!

133
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,079
Listen to me.

134
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:52,920
Dongshan Tai's been here for years.

135
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,839
His network runs deep.

136
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:57,199
Elders like Fei Liu and Mai Gao

137
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:58,519
have deep financial ties to him.

138
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,079
Boss Hui is already dead.

139
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,040
I don't want the same for you.

140
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,480
It's not too late to walk away.

141
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:12,279
Worst case, we leave

142
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,879
and make a living somewhere else.

143
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:15,120
Leave?

144
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,360
Where would I even go?

145
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:20,399
How long will you keep taking this?

146
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,800
Keeping quiet won't earn respect.

147
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,639
And it won't make them stop.

148
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,360
That shipment,

149
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,439
I'll get it back if it kills me.

150
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:31,519
Are you coming?

151
00:08:32,879 --> 00:08:34,080
If not, I'll go alone.

152
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:35,559
Lin! Lin!

153
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,360
Get lost!

154
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,039
Boss Liu.

155
00:08:59,679 --> 00:09:00,320
Sit down.

156
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,840
I'm here to get my shipment back.

157
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:07,840
Your shipment?

158
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,320
What shipment?

159
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:17,679
What's this supposed to mean?

160
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:19,279
Big appetite, huh?

161
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:20,960
Still not enough?

162
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,720
You think you can scare me?

163
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,480
Your turn, Boss Liu.

164
00:09:58,279 --> 00:09:59,200
Then I'll wait

165
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,480
for you to return my shipment.

166
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,639
You've had those snacks for two days.

167
00:10:14,919 --> 00:10:16,200
When will you take them to your brother?

168
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,600
I've still got things to deal with.

169
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:24,320
I'll go in a few days.

170
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,080
I know you have a lot going on,

171
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,080
and you're under pressure.

172
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,279
But no matter what,

173
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:29,919
your only family should come first.

174
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,720
You were too harsh that day.

175
00:10:34,039 --> 00:10:35,320
Fu's been blaming himself ever since.

176
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,320
I feel like playing pool.

177
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,159
Come on.

178
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,000
Let's shoot a couple games.

179
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:49,679
Tai.

180
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,720
Are you going to deal with this or not?

181
00:10:52,919 --> 00:10:53,600
Boss Liu.

182
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:57,480
You took Shen Yanlin's shipment first.

183
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,639
If Boss Yong hears about this,

184
00:11:00,399 --> 00:11:02,440
we'd be in the wrong.

185
00:11:03,519 --> 00:11:06,039
Shen Yanlin's business is booming.

186
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:09,200
You really want to let him get bigger

187
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,480
and challenge you for shot-caller?

188
00:11:14,279 --> 00:11:14,720
Boss Tai.

189
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:16,960
Shen Yanlin has crossed the line.

190
00:11:17,399 --> 00:11:18,120
If you step in,

191
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:20,120
teach him a lesson for Boss Hui,

192
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,639
the other elders won't object.

193
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,519
Exactly.

194
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:27,799
Fine.

195
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,919
Let's remind Shen Yanlin

196
00:11:31,559 --> 00:11:32,600
who's in charge.

197
00:11:43,799 --> 00:11:44,840
Boss Tai and Boss Liu

198
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,399
sent us to teach you some manners.

199
00:11:47,559 --> 00:11:48,039
Get them!

200
00:11:58,960 --> 00:11:59,639
Go!

201
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:00,679
Go!

202
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:16,240
Fei Liu won't let this go.

203
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,919
Dongshan Tai backing him

204
00:12:19,919 --> 00:12:21,000
shows where he stands.

205
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,080
What are you going to do?

206
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:26,639
Even if Boss Jiu backs us,

207
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:29,559
my votes,

208
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,080
businesses,

209
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:32,279
and money

210
00:12:32,879 --> 00:12:34,200
still can't match Dongshan Tai's.

211
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,960
If I want to be shot-caller...

212
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,279
You need a way to break the deadlock.

213
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,120
It's okay.

214
00:12:55,639 --> 00:12:56,440
I'll get it. I'll get it.

215
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,759
L-Lin...

216
00:13:04,639 --> 00:13:08,120
I-I'm sorry.

217
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:15,360
Fu.

218
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:17,200
Look at me.

219
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,759
Look at me.

220
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:24,120
All our lives,

221
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,960
haven't we said sorry enough?

222
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,759
You dropped some pens. So what?

223
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:29,799
What are you sorry for?

224
00:13:30,519 --> 00:13:31,559
Is "sorry" all you know how to say?

225
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,360
Lin.

226
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:33,840
That's enough.

227
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,320
Lin...

228
00:13:47,159 --> 00:13:48,960
I'm sorry.

229
00:13:50,519 --> 00:13:51,360
Lin...

230
00:13:52,519 --> 00:13:54,519
I-I'm sorry, Lin.

231
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,399
Go draw something.

232
00:13:57,279 --> 00:13:57,960
Draw.

233
00:13:59,039 --> 00:13:59,720
Draw.

234
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,360
What did you draw?

235
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:17,960
Fu.

236
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:20,919
Lin.

237
00:14:22,799 --> 00:14:24,559
When we were little.

238
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:28,159
Were you really this skinny as a kid?

239
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,600
Why isn't Wangcai in it?

240
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,360
Lin

241
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:40,000
bought Wangcai

242
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:42,240
for me.

243
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:49,080
I really like Wangcai.

244
00:14:51,559 --> 00:14:53,960
Is that why you sleep hugging him?

245
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,840
I'm scared of the dark.

246
00:14:57,399 --> 00:15:00,720
Lin gave me

247
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,120
Wangcai.

248
00:15:03,639 --> 00:15:05,159
Woof! Woof!

249
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,399
Because you're scared of the dark,

250
00:15:10,039 --> 00:15:11,639
Lin bought Wangcai

251
00:15:12,399 --> 00:15:13,399
to sleep with you,

252
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,679
so you wouldn't be scared.

253
00:15:17,679 --> 00:15:21,200
It's all my fault.

254
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:33,200
Mr. Wan, as a newly elected councilman,

255
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,320
you proposed
Shicheng Ten-Year Development Plan.

256
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:37,159
Some question your business background

257
00:15:37,159 --> 00:15:38,159
and lack of political experience.

258
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:38,879
How do you respond?

259
00:15:39,399 --> 00:15:39,919
That's true.

260
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:42,480
I come from the business world.

261
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:45,200
But that's exactly
what gives me an edge.

262
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,519
I know

263
00:15:47,919 --> 00:15:49,720
how to turn a run-down street

264
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,399
into a thriving business district.

265
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,120
Over the past decade,

266
00:15:53,799 --> 00:15:54,799
I've put up buildings,

267
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:55,799
repaired roads,

268
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,200
and paid my taxes.

269
00:15:57,559 --> 00:16:00,159
That's more than
some have done with talk.

270
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,279
I used to think

271
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,320
the toughest man

272
00:16:05,559 --> 00:16:06,440
got to call the shots.

273
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,000
Boss Hui was tough enough.

274
00:16:10,399 --> 00:16:11,200
But in the end,

275
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:13,840
the one with power

276
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:16,120
gets the final say.

277
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:19,720
Lin.

278
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:22,240
Being the shot-caller won't be easy.

279
00:16:23,759 --> 00:16:26,720
You'll face
even tougher power struggles.

280
00:16:27,639 --> 00:16:28,960
Could it really be harder

281
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:30,600
than what my brother and I went through?

282
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,000
If that's what you want.

283
00:16:47,639 --> 00:16:49,200
I asked
Men Datou and Guoshan Feng to meet.

284
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,000
Will they help us?

285
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,440
I don't know.

286
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,240
But all they care about is profit.

287
00:16:59,279 --> 00:17:01,200
If my offer is good enough,

288
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:04,119
we'll see
if they'll give me their votes.

289
00:17:09,786 --> 00:17:13,053
♪They tell me not to walk head bowed♪

290
